# Torch checkpoints. train.py writes `model` into experiments/<n>/ and into
# src/segmentation/inference/; the inference scripts torch.load("model") from
# their working directory. Anchored to that tree on purpose — the unanchored
# `model.*` these replace also matched things like .agents/context/model.md.
src/segmentation/model
src/segmentation/**/model
src/segmentation/**/model.[!m]*
.idea/
src/segmentation/training/src/experiments/
src/segmentation/training/src/test_clean.csv
src/segmentation/training/src/train_clean.csv
